<title>USA: Humphreys Cty, Miss., won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Humphreys Cty, Miss., won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach, Inc., said it won $2.600 million of Humphreys Cty, Miss., general obligation road and bridge bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.26 percent.</p>
</text>
